---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy & PDPA Declaration - AmerisPro">
  <div class="legal-page">
    <div class="container">
      
      <!-- Hero Header -->
      <div class="legal-hero">
        <div class="badge badge-legal">🔒 Data Protection & Legal Compliance</div>
        <h1 class="legal-title">Privacy Policy & PDPA Declaration</h1>
        <p class="legal-subtitle">
          AmerisPro is committed to protecting your personal data in strict compliance with the 
          <strong>Malaysian Personal Data Protection Act 2010 (Act 709)</strong>, 2024 Amendments, and international <strong>GDPR standards</strong>.
        </p>
        <div class="legal-meta">
          <span>📅 Effective Date: July 25, 2026</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>🌍 Applicable Region: Malaysia & Global</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Language Switcher Tabs -->
      <div class="tab-switcher">
        <button type="button" id="tab-btn-en" class="tab-btn active">
          🇬🇧 English (Global & PDPA)
        </button>
        <button type="button" id="tab-btn-bm" class="tab-btn">
          🇲🇾 Bahasa Melayu (Notis PDPA)
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- ENGLISH CONTENT -->
      <div id="content-en" class="legal-content">
        <div class="legal-card">
          <h2>1. Introduction & Scope</h2>
          <p>
            This Privacy Policy describes how AmerisPro ("we," "our," or "us") collects, uses, stores, and protects personal and organizational data when you use the AmerisPro Safety Hub SaaS platform ("Service").
          </p>
          <p>
            Whether you are on a <strong>14-Day Free Trial</strong> or a <strong>Premium Subscription</strong>, we adhere to the 7 Core Principles of the Malaysian Personal Data Protection Act 2010 (PDPA) and EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) standards.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-card">
          <h2>2. The 7 PDPA Principles We Adhere To</h2>
          <div class="principle-grid">
            <div class="principle-item">
              <span class="principle-num">1</span>
              <h4>General Principle (Consent)</h4>
              <p>We process your personal data only with your explicit consent obtained during user registration or Google OAuth authorization.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="principle-item">
              <span class="principle-num">2</span>
              <h4>Notice & Choice Principle</h4>
              <p>You are informed in advance about what data is collected (name, email, site inspection logs, PPE records) and how it is used.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="principle-item">
              <span class="principle-num">3</span>
              <h4>Disclosure Principle</h4>
              <p>We never sell, rent, or trade your data. Data is disclosed only to essential sub-processors (Supabase Cloud, Vercel, Payment Gateways).</p>
            </div>
            <div class="principle-item">
              <span class="principle-num">4</span>
              <h4>Security Principle</h4>
              <p>All data in transit is encrypted via SSL/TLS 256-bit. Database tables are isolated per organization using PostgreSQL Row Level Security (RLS).</p>
            </div>
            <div class="principle-item">
              <span class="principle-num">5</span>
              <h4>Retention Principle</h4>
              <p>Your workspace data is retained for the duration of your active subscription and deleted upon account termination request.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="principle-item">
              <span class="principle-num">6</span>
              <h4>Data Integrity Principle</h4>
              <p>We maintain accurate and up-to-date records. Users can update their workspace and staff profiles at any time inside Settings.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="principle-item">
              <span class="principle-num">7</span>
              <h4>Access Principle</h4>
              <p>You have full rights to request access to, download, or request deletion of all personal data stored in your workspace.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-card">
          <h2>3. Data Infrastructure & Sub-Processors</h2>
          <p>AmerisPro relies on enterprise-grade cloud providers to deliver fast and secure service in Southeast Asia:</p>
          <table class="legal-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Sub-Processor</th>
                <th>Role / Purpose</th>
                <th>Data Hosting Region</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Supabase Cloud</strong></td>
                <td>Database, Authentication, Storage & Row-Level Security</td>
                <td>Singapore Region (sin1)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Vercel Inc.</strong></td>
                <td>Serverless Application Hosting & Edge Functions</td>
                <td>Singapore Region (sin1)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>HitPay / ToyyibPay</strong></td>
                <td>Payment Gateway (FPX, DuitNow QR, TNG eWallet, Cards)</td>
                <td>Malaysia</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-card">
          <h2>4. AI Legal Search & Document Processing</h2>
          <p>
            AmerisPro features an <strong>AI OSH Legal Vector Search Engine</strong> that indexes Malaysian safety legislation (Act 514, Act 872, Act 302, USECHH 2000).
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Search queries are processed anonymously against vectorized public legal statutes.</li>
            <li>Trial accounts receive <strong>25 AI Legal Search credits</strong> during the 14-day trial period.</li>
            <li>Premium accounts receive <strong>100 AI Legal Search credits/month</strong>.</li>
            <li>Your proprietary site records, private inspection photos, and staff lists are <strong>NEVER used to train AI models</strong>.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-card">
          <h2>5. Your Rights & Data Export</h2>
          <p>Under Section 30 of Malaysia PDPA 2010, you are entitled to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Export your inspection logs, PPE inventory, and contractor records to CSV/Excel at any time.</li>
            <li>Request permanent account and workspace deletion by emailing our privacy team.</li>
            <li>Revoke Google OAuth permissions directly inside your Google Account Security Settings.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- BAHASA MELAYU CONTENT -->
      <div id="content-bm" class="legal-content" hidden>
        <div class="legal-card">
          <h2>1. Notis Perlindungan Data Peribadi (Akta 709)</h2>
          <p>
            Notis ini dikeluarkan mengikut keperluan <strong>Seksyen 7 Akta Perlindungan Data Peribadi 2010 (PDPA)</strong> Malaysia. 
            AmerisPro ("kami") menghormati privasi anda dan komited untuk melindungi data peribadi anda.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-card">
          <h2>2. Jenis Data Yang Dikitip</h2>
          <p>Kami mengumpul maklumat berikut untuk menyediakan perkhidmatan sistem pengurusan keselamatan OSH:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Maklumat Akaun:</strong> Nama pengguna, alamat e-mel, nama syarikat/organisasi.</li>
            <li><strong>Data Rekod Keselamatan:</strong> Log pemeriksaan tapak, laporan insiden, kuantiti stok PPE, senarai kontraktor dan tandatangan digital.</li>
            <li><strong>Data Pembayaran:</strong> Transaksi langganan disemak secara selamat melalui gerbang pembayaran FPX / DuitNow QR.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-card">
          <h2>3. Tujuan Pemprosesan Data</h2>
          <p>Data peribadi anda diproses untuk tujuan berikut sahaja:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Menyediakan akses kepada platform SaaS AmerisPro.</li>
            <li>Mengesahkan identiti pengguna semasa log masuk Google OAuth.</li>
            <li>Memproses langganan akaun Percubaan 14 Hari dan Akaun Premium.</li>
            <li>Menjana laporan audit PDF dan eksport data CSV untuk pemeriksaan Jabatan Keselamatan dan Kesihatan Pekerjaan (JKKP / DOSH).</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-card">
          <h2>4. Keselamatan & Hak Pengguna</h2>
          <p>
            Semua data anda disimpan di pusat data Singapura yang dilindungi oleh penyulitan SSL 256-bit dan dasar <i>Row Level Security (RLS)</i>.
          </p>
          <p>
            Anda mempunyai hak mengikut Akta 709 untuk mengakses, membetulkan, memuat turun, atau meminta pemadaman data peribadi anda pada bila-bila masa.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Legal Contact Footer Card -->
      <div class="legal-card legal-contact-card">
        <h3>💬 Questions regarding your data privacy?</h3>
        <p>If you have any questions or wish to exercise your PDPA rights, please contact our Data Protection Officer at:</p>
        <a href="mailto:privacy@amerispro.com" class="legal-contact-btn">✉️ Contact Privacy Officer</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<script>
  const btnEn = document.getElementById('tab-btn-en');
  const btnBm = document.getElementById('tab-btn-bm');
  const contentEn = document.getElementById('content-en');
  const contentBm = document.getElementById('content-bm');

  if (btnEn && btnBm && contentEn && contentBm) {
    btnEn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      btnEn.classList.add('active');
      btnBm.classList.remove('active');
      contentEn.hidden = false;
      contentBm.hidden = true;
    });

    btnBm.addEventListener('click', () => {
      btnBm.classList.add('active');
      btnEn.classList.remove('active');
      contentBm.hidden = false;
      contentEn.hidden = true;
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 40px 16px 64px;
    background: #FFF9EC;
    min-height: 100vh;
    font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
    color: #2B2D42;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .legal-hero {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .badge-legal {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    background: #FFD166;
    border: 3px solid #2B2D42;
    border-radius: 20px;
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0px #2B2D42;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .legal-title {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .legal-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #4A4E69;
  }

  .legal-meta {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #6C757D;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  /* Tab Switcher */
  .tab-switcher {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .tab-btn {
    padding: 10px 20px;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    color: #2B2D42;
    border: 3px solid #2B2D42;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0px #2B2D42;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s;
  }

  .tab-btn:hover {
    transform: translate(-1px, -1px);
    box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px #2B2D42;
  }

  .tab-btn.active {
    background: #FFD166;
    transform: translate(1px, 1px);
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #2B2D42;
  }

  /* Cards */
  .legal-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .legal-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 3px solid #2B2D42;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 28px;
    box-shadow: 5px 5px 0px #2B2D42;
  }

  .legal-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    color: #2B2D42;
    border-bottom: 2.5px solid #FFD166;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .legal-card p, .legal-card li {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #333333;
  }

  .legal-card ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  .legal-card li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  /* Grid */
  .principle-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .principle-item {
    background: #FFF9EC;
    border: 2.5px solid #2B2D42;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px;
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0px #2B2D42;
  }

  .principle-num {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    line-height: 28px;
    text-align: center;
    background: #FFD166;
    border: 2px solid #2B2D42;
    border-radius: 50%;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .principle-item h4 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .principle-item p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Table */
  .legal-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .legal-table th, .legal-table td {
    border: 2px solid #2B2D42;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .legal-table th {
    background: #FFEED2;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  /* Contact Card */
  .legal-contact-card {
    background: #FFEED2;
    text-align: center;

  .legal-contact-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .legal-contact-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 14px;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    background: #2B2D42;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 10px;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 2.5px solid #2B2D42;
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0px #FFD166;
    transition: transform 0.1s;
  }

  .legal-contact-btn:hover {
    transform: translate(-1px, -1px);
  }
</style>
